# graph: couples=knob:SITE_KIT_DOCS_DIR/*.md,knob:SITE_KIT_DOCS_DIR/*/index.md,knob:SITE_KIT_DOCS_DIR/posts/*.md,knob:SITE_KIT_LIQUID_TEMPLATES dir=one valve=none tier=precommit
# install: on-surface
# spec: site-kit/SPEC.md §check-docs-liquid-parse — every tracked docs file the Pages build runs Liquid over (markdown pages, front-matter files, and the templates SITE_KIT_LIQUID_TEMPLATES names) parses under the parser SITE_KIT_LIQUID_PARSER names; a parser that fails its probe or returns a short count refuses
